      "writtenOn": "2023-03-20T23:13:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Changing the settings will have an impact on transactions PI. These values are still used to determine the minimum node priority. So I don\u0027t know that clearing them will have a positive performance impact.\n\nThe idea here is to flag userspace misconfiguration. This change doesn\u0027t really target a \"problem\" with the driver\u0027s behavior.\n\nI could explore the idea of clearing these values which is basically the same as forcing: SCHED_NORMAL, nice(0) and !inherit_rt. However, this would require doing a deeper performance testing.",
      "parentUuid": "bbd95ea9_e5ec82e8",
      "revId": "6600ba5dca3990e48f2322fdda09058455509989",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
